      "message": "I used to think it was 1-byte; but actually it is not. The following BUILD_ASSERT passes to confirm that. Looks like we don\u0027t pass `-fshort-enums` to the toolchain so it defaults to 4-byte. Now use `uint8_t` to avoid any ambiguity.\n```\nBUILD_ASSERT(sizeof(enum ec_led_id) \u003d\u003d 4);\n```",
